<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara burned 11 family members to death, abducted five children from the same family, and attacked a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide and abducting worshippers. In Plateau, gunmen killed herders and farmers, killed an Operation Rainbow commander, and burned seven houses, prompting a curfew. President Tinubu apologized for his absence after the Plateau attack and announced a five-year defence plan as AI-generated disinformation spreads ahead of the election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPM0ZmYTRGRFlDYW8tejdiSnZEU0NKWnZHZG5GY0lDRmZGQjYyRVc5Ty1vNE1Lbll6WVVIY0kzYzF6Rzd2VDMtQkFnTEY3dFBGQzVZczY0YjBBV0dfMUg4RW1kVHVvS2ZDTUlqWnMyeHdGSVliV2ZkTVJpU0xOLU13OWlLaTBOcjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBNeVpvTFo2c1pmVmNhWXpTOC1oRGxTQkIwTllCN2w3MXRFVFp0Q2x5TVg4UV9kUWRkQUNSN25ocDZWd0QxSlVSTFV3T0NvaFhJZUlFTHVxVVpfTHZQMEFkR0Z2d3NlQXF6NGlmZDFiVWVESXZ3dWVtTEUwQWZXTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPalcybzc0TUF4QWVZRzUzb0xZbXNaaVpiN2EwZm9pdnJ6cWR6ZzBYOWxrOGYwbWt5QWJsX0paRU5NZllVRUdQUjdJQ0kxNW1RM1A3SDJjMGxTNUhCWk85ZnVIZ1NkNmJ3RmJMbmF5azcwRzBpNXBERUNxM0Y5dFl6cEpZczNjVWgzSldRVm5DVTQyV3p0RzNCV1dJNURPVFRxaUkza290bTdPM2R3UXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;THISDAYLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOMWJGbnluX0FReHNBVGZqS1BZTVhCMFRIS1VPa3VPNlRjZE5BeEFwLTh6TUMyMi1VS2xsTGI1TGwzdGJ0ZHFWWnVtR3dURENMLXVv